  "question": {
    "text": "If the equation of the plane passing through the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp;and perpendicular to the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>140</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "15",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Equation of the required plane is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Since, required plane is perpendicular to the line&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></math>, therefore normal vector of the plane is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover></math></p><p>So, direction ratios&nbsp;of normal to the plane is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p><p>Equation of plane is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>28</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>28</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>y</mi></mrow><mn>28</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>z</mi><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>28</mn><mn>11</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Comparing with&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>28</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>28</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>28</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>So,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>140</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>140</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>11</mn><mn>28</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>28</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>28</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>140</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>140</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>28</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></math></p>"
  }
}